<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Use this macro to store items you loot into the store, you have to put the store scroll in number3 and make sure the mouse position is in rightplcae when using the scroll. let the magic work :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 32 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 224 1
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 7 300
KeyUp 224 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rappelz</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>